Subject: [PATCH] imv: make Meson/stat usage portable to iOS

iOS has no separate librt, and Darwin exposes a portable st_mtime scalar rather
than Linux's st_mtim.tv_sec field.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build	2025-11-27 12:03:44
+++ b/meson.build	2026-07-04 23:46:35
@@ -98 +98 @@
-    cc.find_library('rt'),
+    cc.find_library('rt', required: false),
diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/src/navigator.c b/src/navigator.c
--- a/src/navigator.c	2025-11-27 12:03:44
+++ b/src/navigator.c	2026-07-04 23:46:35
@@ -313 +313 @@
-    time_t file_changed = file_info.st_mtim.tv_sec;
+    time_t file_changed = file_info.st_mtime;
